OL,3,ABinance users withdraw $3.6bn after
OL,4,Alargest-ever crypto hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FBinance customers withdrew $3.6bn
OL,7,F(#2.7bn) of assets from the world's
OL,8,Fbiggest cryptocurrency exchange as it
OL,9,Freopened on Sunday following what is
OL,10,Fbelieved to be the largest hack in
OL,11,Fhistory.
OL,13,FThe firm suspended all transactions in
OL,14,Fthe wake of the incident, which
OL,15,Fimpacted $6.3bn worth of digital
OL,16,Fassets.
OL,18,FMajor organisations, including the US
OL,19,FFederal Bureau of Investigation (FBI),
OL,20,Fhave accused North Korea of being
OL,21,Fresponsible for the cyber-attack.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
