OL,3,AHow city became home of drum and bass
OL,4,Aand jungle
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been more than 30 years since
OL,7,FBristol with a "rebel" mentality
OL,8,Fventured into the unknown, giving birth
OL,9,Fto the global phenomenon that is jungle
OL,10,Fand drum and bass music.
OL,12,FThe city is still a heavyweight on the
OL,13,Fscene, inspiring generations of artists
OL,14,Fto continue pushing boundaries in dance
OL,15,Fmusic.
OL,17,FJungle continues to be developed by
OL,18,Fartists across London and Bristol, but
OL,19,Fin its beginnings the sound from
OL,20,FBristol was more expansive and
OL,21,Fexperimental.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
